      "source": "We have a pretty simple domain object here.\nNote that it has a <code>@RedisHash</code> annotation on its type and a property named <code>id</code> that is annotated with <code>org.springframework.data.annotation.Id</code>.\nThose two items are responsible for creating the actual key used to persist the hash.",
      "translation": "我们这里有一个相当简单的领域对象。  \n请注意，该类型上带有 `<code>@RedisHash</code>` 注解，并且有一个名为 `<code>id</code>` 的属性，该属性被标注为 `<code>org.springframework.data.annotation.Id</code>`。  \n这两个元素负责创建用于持久化哈希的实际键。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In some cases, you need not load and rewrite the entire entity just to set a new value within it.\nA session timestamp for the last active time might be such a scenario where you want to alter one property.\n<code>PartialUpdate</code> lets you define <code>set</code> and <code>delete</code> actions on existing objects while taking care of updating potential expiration times of both the entity itself and index structures.\nThe following example shows a partial update:",
      "translation": "在某些情况下，您无需加载并重写整个实体即可设置其中的新值。例如，若要修改会话中最后一次活跃时间的属性，便属于此类场景。<code>PartialUpdate</code> 允许您在现有对象上定义 <code>set</code> 和 <code>delete</code> 操作，同时自动处理实体本身及索引结构可能涉及的过期时间更新。以下示例展示了部分更新的操作方式：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
