      "translation": "由于我们的仓库扩展了<code>CrudRepository</code>，因此它提供了基本的 CRUD 和查询操作。\n我们需要一个相应的 Spring 配置来将这些组件连接起来，示例如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Given the preceding setup, we can inject <code>PersonRepository</code> into our components, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "基于上述配置，我们可以将 <code>PersonRepository</code> 注入到组件中，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Marking properties with <code>@Reference</code> allows storing a simple key reference instead of copying values into the hash itself.\nOn loading from Redis, references are resolved automatically and mapped back into the object, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "使用 `<code>@Reference</code>` 标记属性，允许存储简单的键引用，而无需将值复制到哈希表中。\n从 Redis 加载时，引用会自动解析并映射回对象中，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
