      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>Set the simple <code>firstname</code> property to <code>mat</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>Set the simple 'address.city' property to 'emond’s field' without having to pass in the entire object.\nThis does not work when a custom conversion is registered.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>Remove the <code>age</code> property.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>Set complex <code>address</code> property.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>Set a map of values, which removes the previously existing map and replaces the values with the given ones.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"6\"></i><b>6</b></td>\n<td>Automatically update the server expiration time when altering <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"expirations.html\">Time To Live</a>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>将简单的 <code>firstname</code> 属性设置为 <code>mat</code>。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>将简单的 'address.city' 属性设置为 'emond's field'，而无需传入整个对象。\n当注册了自定义转换器时，此方法不起作用。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>移除 <code>age</code> 属性。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>设置复杂的 <code>address</code> 属性。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>设置一个值映射，这将移除先前存在的映射，并用给定的值替换它们。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"6\"></i><b>6</b></td>\n<td>在修改 <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"expirations.html\">生存时间 (Time To Live)</a> 时，自动更新服务器过期时间。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
