    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nProperties annotated with <code>@Id</code> as well as those named <code>id</code> are considered as the identifier properties.\nThose with the annotation are favored over others.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n使用 <code>@Id</code> 注解标注的属性以及名为 <code>id</code> 的属性均被视为标识符属性。带有该注解的属性优先于其他属性被选用。\n</td>\n</tr>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>Reference stores the whole key (<code>keyspace:id</code>) of the referenced object.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>Reference 存储被引用对象的整个键（<code>keyspace:id</code>）。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-warning\" title=\"Warning\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nReferenced Objects are not persisted when the referencing object is saved.\nYou must persist changes on referenced objects separately, since only the reference is stored.\nIndexes set on properties of referenced types are not resolved.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-warning\" title=\"警告\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n引用对象在保存引用对象时不会被持久化。\n由于仅存储了引用，因此必须单独对引用对象的更改进行持久化处理。\n为引用类型属性设置的索引无法解析。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nUpdating complex objects as well as map (or other collection) structures requires further interaction with Redis to determine existing values, which means that rewriting the entire entity might be faster.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n更新复杂对象以及 Map（或其他集合）结构需要与 Redis 进行进一步交互以确定现有值，这意味着重写整个实体可能更快。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#redis.repositories.references\"></a>Persisting References",
      "translation": "<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#redis.repositories.references\"></a>持久化引用",
      "count": 1
    },
